# Cardory 项目的 Git 忽略规则。
# 忽略编译产物、IDE/编辑器配置、平台自动生成的临时文件以及本地敏感配置。

# Miscellaneous
*.class
*.log
*.pyc
*.swp
.DS_Store
.atom/
.buildlog/
.history
.svn/
migrate_working_dir/

# Dart runtime cache / workspace data
.dart-appdata/
.codebuddy/

# Flutter project metadata (auto-generated)
.metadata

# IntelliJ related
*.iml
*.ipr
*.iws
.idea/

# Visual Studio Code related
.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/
.vs/
/windows/out/
**/windows/flutter/ephemeral/
**/ephemeral/
**/GeneratedPluginRegistrant.*
key.properties
*.jks
*.keystore

# IntelliJ / Android Studio
.idea/
*.iml

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android build artifacts
/android/build/
/android/app/build/

# 与软件构建无关的文档与素材：本地保留，不再推送到 GitHub（2026-09-08）
/CONTEXT.md
/docs/
/assets/branding/app_icon_productivity.png
/assets/branding/README.md
/tools/
